OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,6,Fat first, clearing through the morning
OL,7,Fto leave generally dry conditions with
OL,8,Fsunny spells. Blustery showers
OL,9,Fdeveloping through the afternoon,
OL,10,Fheavy at times.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThe blustery showers
OL,13,Fcontinuing through the evening, though
OL,14,Fsome cloud breaks may develop in the
OL,15,Feast. Widely windy with strong gusts,
OL,16,Fespecially on the coast.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSaturday:FA mixture of sunshine and
OL,19,Fshowers through the day, mostly
OL,20,Fclearing up through the evening. Very
OL,21,Fwindy, with coastal gales possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
