OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:
OL,6,FGenerally fine and dry on Sunday. Rain
OL,7,Fand low cloud for early Monday, heavy
OL,8,Fat times. Drier Monday afternoon with
OL,9,Ffurther rain Tuesday morning. Then
OL,10,Fmostly dry with sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
